[en.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_036]
The Nepotism Dilemma

[en.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_036_desc]
Unfortunately, just as the Ponyville government announced that it would crack down on nepotism, the Empress asked us to directly arrange a relative to work at the Ponyville Post Office.
If we accept the Empress’s request, we will violate our own commitment, which will call into question our credibility.
If we refuse the Empress’s request, we will offend the Empress, and the Empress will mobilize her forces to deal with us, affecting our support rate.
If only there was a way to divert attention...

[en.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_036_TOOLTIP]
We have successfully diverted the public’s attention with other news, and now we can fulfill the Empress’s request without being noticed by the public.

[zh.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_036]
裙带关系困局

[zh.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_036_desc]
糟糕的是，就在小马谷政府宣布要打击裙带关系的同时，女皇却要求我们直接安排一个关系户进入小马谷邮局工作。
如果我们接受了女皇的要求，那么我们就会违背自己的承诺，这将会让我们的公信力受到质疑。
如果我们拒绝了女皇的要求，那么我们就会得罪女皇，女皇也会发动她的力量来对付我们，影响我们的支持率。
如果有办法转移注意力就好了...

[zh.DECISION_C02_HOTLINE_036_TOOLTIP]
我们已经成功用其他新闻转移了民众的注意力，现在我们可以完成女皇的要求，同时又不被民众关注了。
